      "invocation": "code-review-graph install --platform claude-code | code-review-graph build|update | CRG MCP tools (impact-radius, review-context, search)",
      "purpose": "Code graph via code-review-graph (CRG) — installs the Claude Code MCP integration (30 MCP tools + slash commands + git hooks); builds/refreshes the code graph; reachability / blast-radius / keyword+semantic search via CRG MCP tools. Replaces graphify; vault-graph & multimodal-ingest uses dropped.",
